  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "武曲与贪狼在丑未同宫，金木相克。任一化禄使金制木而显正面，仍须多吉才免长期劳碌；任一化忌或多煞无吉则负面、劳碌起伏，不利财、亲情人际。作者又论内聚与吝啬、煞冲健康及寿命风险，但不能据此断一定短命，结论仍须旺弱吉凶。末引赋文「灭番」疑字保留。",
  "summary_en": "Military Melody and Greedy Wolf share Chou or Wei, where metal and wood conflict. Prosperity Transformation of either star permits constructive restraint, yet many benefics are needed to avoid lifelong toil. Obstruction Transformation of either, or many malefics without benefics, brings labor, fluctuations and adverse wealth, family and social implications. The author links inward metal qualities to narrowness and stinginess under affliction, and discusses health and longevity risks from conflict and malefic attack. This does not establish inevitable early death; palace strength and favorability remain decisive. The unclear quoted expression Mie Fan is preserved. Alternative transformation-bearing stars are not falsely asserted to transform simultaneously.",
